<title>UK: Crdit Lyonnais sets Gle des Eaux warrants.</title>
<headline>Crdit Lyonnais sets Gle des Eaux warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey) has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Genarale des Eaux, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   06.DEC.96		LISTING     PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER	  1000</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		MATURITY	   STRIKE	   ISSUE</p>
<p>CALL A	26.NOV.98	  650 FFR	  10.44 FFR</p>
<p>CALL B	26.NOV.99	  715 FFR	  10.68 FFR</p>
<p>CALL C	27.NOV.00	  750 FFR	  12.23 FFR</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
